":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会では一部は個人PVの服を着て、二部では↑の写真の服を着たよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこれは飛鳥の服〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テヘペロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリで借りたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/07/22/3445548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、れなりん！卒業おめでと